  "text": "Amazing choice for Mother's Day! There are many ways to prepare a basic omelette, but I'll show you a simple, reliable way to prepare a traditional omelet. Begin by cracking a couple of eggs into a bowl and adding a teaspoon of black pepper and a teaspoon of salt. Then, put the eggs into a pan and heat them over medium heat. Once the eggs begin to solidify, use a spatula to gently fold them in half. Then, sprinkle some shredded cheese over the top of the omelette and cook for a few seconds. Finally, place the omelette on a plate and allow it to cool slightly before serving. Enjoy your special occasion breakfast!",
